::Q001::[markdown]aorist (1) active optative 3rd sing. of the verb “I order”:{
	~%50%κελεύσειεν#Correct: **κελεύσειεν** is the correct form for aorist (1) active optative 3rd sing. of the verb “I order” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%κελεύσετε#Incorrect. **κελεύσετε** is the future active indicative 2nd pl. of the verb “I order” (Ch. 2).
	~%-100%κελεύσεις#Incorrect. **κελεύσεις** is the future active indicative 2nd sing. of the verb “I order” (Ch. 2).
	~%50%κελεύσαι#Correct: **κελεύσαι** is the correct form for aorist (1) active optative 3rd sing. of the verb “I order” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%κεκελεύκαμεν#Incorrect. **κεκελεύκαμεν** is the perfect active indicative 1st pl. of the verb “I order” (Ch. 3).
	~%-100%ἐκέλευσε#Incorrect. **ἐκέλευσε** is the aorist (1) active indicative 3rd sing. of the verb “I order” (Ch. 2).
	~%-100%ἐκέλευε#Incorrect. **ἐκέλευε** is the imperfect active indicative 3rd sing. of the verb “I order” (Ch. 2).
	~%-100%ἐκέλευον#Incorrect. **ἐκέλευον** is the imperfect active indicative 1st sing. of the verb “I order” (Ch. 2).
}


